/T (The scope of this project is deliberately constrained to administrative and informational EdTech queries. The system does not attempt to provide academic tutoring, assess student work, or engage in open-ended philosophical conversation. This constraint is a design choice rather than a limitation: by narrowing the problem space, it becomes possible to achieve high accuracy with a simple, transparent matching mechanism that is interpretable and maintainable without ML expertise.)
/E (The scope of this project is deliberately constrained to administrative and informational EdTech queries. The system does not attempt to provide academic tutoring, assess student work, or engage in open-ended philosophical conversation. This constraint is a design choice rather than a limitation: by narrowing the problem space, it becomes possible to achieve high accuracy with a simple, transparent matching mechanism that is interpretable and maintainable without ML expertise.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
