/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 231 0 R
/T (The system processes each user message independently, with no memory of previous conversation turns. While this simplifies implementation and eliminates state-management complexity, it means the system cannot handle multi-turn clarification dialogues. Each query must be self-contained and interpretable in isolation.)
/E (The system processes each user message independently, with no memory of previous conversation turns. While this simplifies implementation and eliminates state-management complexity, it means the system cannot handle multi-turn clarification dialogues. Each query must be self-contained and interpretable in isolation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
