/T (The Presentation Tier comprises two delivery channels: the terminal-based Command Line Interface \(chatbot.py\) and the browser-based web interface \(web/index.html, style.css, app.js\). Both channels present users with an interactive input mechanism and render bot responses in a channel-appropriate format.)
/E (The Presentation Tier comprises two delivery channels: the terminal-based Command Line Interface \(chatbot.py\) and the browser-based web interface \(web/index.html, style.css, app.js\). Both channels present users with an interactive input mechanism and render bot responses in a channel-appropriate format.)
/Pg 23 0 R
