/T (This two-operation pipeline eliminates the two most common sources of match failure: case mismatches \("COURSES" vs "courses"\) and accidental padding spaces \(common when copying and pasting\). The function has no branches, no side effects, and no external dependencies, making it trivially testable and immune to edge-case failures that affect more complex preprocessing pipelines.)
