/T (4.6 CLI Interface Implementation The Command Line Interface \(chatbot.py\) implements a terminal-based input-process-output loop. On startup, it displays an ASCII art banner, the project title "Optimization Strategies for Natural Language Interface for EdTech Infrastructure", and the student roll number PRJN26-127, establishing the system's identity before the first user interaction.)
/E (4.6 CLI Interface Implementation The Command Line Interface \(chatbot.py\) implements a terminal-based input-process-output loop. On startup, it displays an ASCII art banner, the project title "Optimization Strategies for Natural Language Interface for EdTech Infrastructure", and the student roll number PRJN26-127, establishing the system's identity before the first user interaction.)
