/T (The 11 failures break down as: 4 novel synonyms not in trigger phrase sets \(e.g., "tuition cost" missing "fee"\); 3 multi-intent queries where first-match priority returned a less relevant intent; 2 spelling variants \("schedual", "corses"\) not handled by current normalization; and 2 true out-of-domain queries handled by fallback but judged suboptimally by evaluators.)
