/T (The primary limitation is sensitivity to vocabulary not included in the trigger phrase sets. A student asking "What is the tuition for the Python course?" will not receive the course fee response if "tuition" is not in the course_fee trigger phrase list. Unlike neural systems that generalize from training examples to unseen phrasings, the rule-based system has zero generalization: an unlisted word produces no match.)
