/P 260 0 R
/T (Separation of matching logic from knowledge base content proved enormously valuable in practice. Multiple iterations of knowledge base improvements were made during development without any modification to the matching engine. This decoupling significantly accelerated the development cycle and will continue to benefit the system as it evolves.)
/E (Separation of matching logic from knowledge base content proved enormously valuable in practice. Multiple iterations of knowledge base improvements were made during development without any modification to the matching engine. This decoupling significantly accelerated the development cycle and will continue to benefit the system as it evolves.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
966 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 260 0 R
/T (The core technical contributions are: \(1\) a two-operation input normalization pipeline improving intent-match accuracy by 23 percentage points over a raw comparison baseline; \(2\) a greedy substring matching engine handling diverse natural language phrasings; \(3\) a modular knowledge base architecture enabling independent maintenance of matching logic and response content; \(4\) a dual-mode deployment supporting CLI and web interfaces from a shared Python core; and \(5\) a comprehensive 24-case automated test suite ensuring correctness across edge cases. Quantitative evaluation on a 100-query benchmark demonstrated 89% first-intent match accuracy with 22ms median response latency.)
/E (The core technical contributions are: \(1\) a two-operation input normalization pipeline improving intent-match accuracy by 23 percentage points over a raw comparison baseline; \(2\) a greedy substring matching engine handling diverse natural language phrasings; \(3\) a modular knowledge base architecture enabling independent maintenance of matching logic and response content; \(4\) a dual-mode deployment supporting CLI and web interfaces from a shared Python core; and \(5\) a comprehensive 24-case automated test suite ensuring correctness across edge cases. Quantitative evaluation on a 100-query benchmark demonstrated 89% first-intent match accuracy with 22ms median response latency.)
/Pg 47 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
