/Title (Accepts free-form natural language input without requiring users to memorize exact command syntax. Returns accurate, domain-appropriate responses for at least ten categories of EdTech queries. Operates with response latency below 100 milliseconds on commodity hardware. Requires no cloud NLP services or pre-trained neural models. Can be deployed and maintained by staff with standard Python programming skills. Functions consistently across CLI and web delivery channels from a single shared codebase. Provides auditable interaction logs for compliance and continuous improvement purposes.)
