/Title (Response strings use a consistent formatting convention: a Unicode icon followed by an uppercase title, a row of equals signs as a visual separator, substantive content with appropriate indentation and structure, another separator, and a closing actionable suggestion. This convention is applied uniformly across all ten intent responses plus the default fallback, creating a coherent visual language throughout the system's outputs.)
/Dest [28 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3292 0 R
/Prev 3296 0 R
/First 3312 0 R
