/Title (5.4 Manual Evaluation Methodology In addition to automated unit tests, the system was manually evaluated using a benchmark of 100 questions representing the full range of natural language variation expected from real student users. The benchmark was constructed by: \(1\) collecting 40 common student queries from online EdTech forums and university FAQ pages; \(2\) augmenting with 30 paraphrases generated by the development team targeting synonym coverage; \(3\) adding 20 adversarial queries probing boundary conditions including multi-intent queries and novel vocabulary; plus 10 out-of-domain queries that should correctly return the default fallback response.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
